Add --project-root and count a real invocation of the skill as a trigger

find_project_root() walks up from the script's cwd, so run from outside a
repo it lands in ~/.claude and claude -p runs in the home directory.
--project-root makes the repo explicit. The detector also accepted only its
hashed decoy name; when the skill is installed normally the model invokes
the real name, which now counts.

